                  <p><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="5" align="center"><b> 
                    Israel: Arafat and Tanzim not in control of suicide bombers 
                    -- will the media spot the double talk?</b></font></p>
                </div>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr align="left" valign="top"> 
              <td height="2"> 
