              <td height="520"> 
                <p> 
                </p><p> 
                </p><p><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><b>PMWATCH 
                  - July 24, 2002</b> -- We've been hammered for two years now 
                  with the incessant propaganda about how Arafat, Tanzim, Hamas, 
                  and the rest, are one and the same, about how the Tanzim are 
                  behind the suicide bombers, and how Arafat himself is total 
                  control of the intifada, suicide bombers and all.</font></p>
                <p><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">But now, 
                  all of a sudden, in order to dismiss the latest efforts by the 
                  Palestinians to move towards a cease fire, <b>Israel is openly 
                  saying that </b></font><b><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Arafat 
                  and Tanzim have no influence on suicide bombers</font></b><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">: 
                  </font></p>
                <blockquote> 
                  <blockquote>
                    <p> <font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">"Tanzim, 
                      the Palestinian militia connected to Yasir Arafat's Fatah 
                      faction, was preparing to announce a unilateral cease-fire 
                      with Israel before an Israeli warplane dropped a one-ton 
                      bomb early Tuesday on a Hamas leader's home in Gaza City, 
                      Palestinian officials and Western diplomats said today. 
                      <b>Israeli officials acknowledged that they had known of 
                      a possible Palestinian cease-fire proposal before the bomb 
                      was dropped, but they dismissed it as a futile attempt by 
                      Palestinians without influence over terrorist groups.</b>" 
                      <a href="#story">The New York Times</a> - July 24, 2002 
                      </font></p>
                    </blockquote>
                </blockquote>
                <p><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Question 
                  to ask: will the media detect this startling statement from 
                  the Israelis? Will they even cover this huge story?</font></p>
                <p><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">If your 
                  paper has not covered it, please ask them why? Contact info 
                  is at: <a href="/sites/pmwatch.org/pmw/volunteer/calling.html">http://www.pmwatch.org/pmw/volunteer/calling.html</a> 
                  </font> </p>
                <p> 
                </p><p><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Your letter 
                  will be sent to:</font> <img src="/sites/pmwatch.org/pmw/images/click_submit.gif" width="105" height="22" name="#submit"></p>
